sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Interior Designer
  participant UI as «boundary»<br/>AvailabilityPage
  participant B as «boundary»<br/>SetAvailabilityBoundary
  participant C as «control»<br/>SetAvailabilityController
  participant Availability as «entity»<br/>Availability
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  A->>UI: mark dates available or unavailable
  UI->>B: PUT /api/designer/availability/{date} (JWT)
  B->>C: set(Integer designerId, LocalDate date, AvailabilityStatus status)
  alt date in the past
    C-->>B: ApiException
    B-->>UI: 400 error JSON
    UI-->>A: show error
  else valid
  C->>Availability: find()
  Availability->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>Availability: rows
  Availability-->>C: result
  C->>Availability: save()
  Availability->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>Availability: rows
  Availability-->>C: result
  C-->>B: AvailabilityDay
  B-->>UI: 200 OK JSON
  UI-->>A: show result
  end